   W138's apply_gen_sch_b_regstage.py (inputs/, fnd/l4reg 86dbcdff): "EN on IOC{t}_LIM_EN, pulled up to +5V_IOC by 100 kOhm
   (R602, R622, R642): the node the peers' restart and the in-service test of L4A-54 and L4A-58 would drive"
   SLVS841F 9.3.1 (page 13, PRINTED): "The device remains off until power is cycled or the device enable is toggled."
     FAULT deglitch on an overcurrent 5 to 10 ms (7.5, page 7, PRINTED)
